v 3
d irw: Stata access to the Item Response Warehouse
d
d The IRW is a corpus of several thousand item response datasets in one
d long format. This package reads it over the warehouse public CSV
d endpoint -- no Redivis account and no SDK -- and bridges the long format
d to the wide one that irt and gsem expect.
d
d Requires: Stata 15
d Distribution-Date: 20261028
d
d Author: Item Response Warehouse, Stanford University
d Support: https://github.com/itemresponsewarehouse/Stata-pkg/issues
d
f irw_cache.ado
f _irw_cachedir.ado
f irw_cite.ado
f _irw_clean.ado
f _irw_dataset.ado
f irw_describe.ado
f irw_fetch.ado
f _irw_get.ado
f irw_info.ado
f irw_itemtext.ado
f _irw_json.ado
f irw_long.ado
f _irw_meta.ado
f irw_metadata.ado
f _irw_metatable.ado
f irw_search.ado
f _irw_shards.ado
f _irw_tableinfo.ado
f _irw_tagkeep.ado
f irw_tags.ado
f irw_wide.ado
f irw_cache.sthlp
f irw_cite.sthlp
f irw_describe.sthlp
f irw_fetch.sthlp
f irw_info.sthlp
f irw_itemtext.sthlp
f irw_long.sthlp
f irw_metadata.sthlp
f irw_search.sthlp
f irw.sthlp
f irw_tags.sthlp
f irw_wide.sthlp
